! CourtTalk Jury
! CourtTalk Version 4.0
! Clearview Jury Interface
! Douglas County Oct 2022
! 
! 10/4/22 - dwg - Added Check Excuse Exempt
! 11/29/22 - dwg - Qualification & BioInfo added
! 01/04/23 - dwg - Douglas OnCall is not used. If OnCall in service week = Completed
! 08/05/23 - dwg - into production
! 08/06/23 - dwg - Removed student exemption
! 08/21/23 - dwg - fixed recording
! 08/25/23 - dwg - **** Changed OnCall msg to Service Ended per court request *******
! 08/25/23 - dwg - Fixed excusal messages
! 08/25/23 - dwg - modified CJ data definitions to CJT for the test/stage database
! 09/15/23 - dwg - added telephone number capture
! 10/30/23 - dwg - fix call in window issues
! 11/09/23 - dwg - fix press # to hear again issue and Reporting date callin window issue
! 03/06/24 - tb  - fixed CheckisReportingDateToday block; added "true", "false" to match output values
! 03/06/24 - eb  - removed caregiver and full time student from request excusal menu and their blocks
! 03/14/24 - dwg - Added isPastReportingDateFtaCutoff js utility
! 09/17/25 - eb  - Douglas clone to CSK
! 03/27/26 - dwg - Update for new REST API block, Get Juror info section
!
